fix(skills): harden syncro skill triggers and fix author metadata

- Add disable-model-invocation to syncro-create-qa-build and
  syncro-create-release so the model can't auto-trigger force-push
  or signed production builds; they only run via the slash command
- Add the missing YAML frontmatter to syncro-create-ticket; without a
  description the model had nothing to match for auto-triggering
- Set metadata.author to alex-salazar (the skill-creator template
  default was gentleman-programming)


